# (build 89) The Prism's four doors on the game's own map. loc_92CC
# writes block $63 at $FFFF9000 + $96, $EC, $7B9, $ED0; loc_6DE8 reads
# that map at row * ($F722 >> 5) + column, 64 on DezolisSkure -- the tmx
# layer's width, so offsets 150, 236, 1977 and 3792 are the blocks at
# cells 44,4 88,6 114,60 32,118, each just above its dungeon's arrival
# cell. play.py's patched map puts them in the same cells; this route
# steps up into each from the cell door_cells gives for it. It passed on
# 88a too: it shows the patches were never the cause of plan()'s stall
# (tools/plan_check.py is that fix's check). dezolis_prism.route covers
# Ikuto. The save is dezolis_prism.json, the Prism in Rolf's bag.

start slot 1 routes/saves/dezolis_prism.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 3 88 8
warp 3 44 6                  # Menobe: block at 44-45, 4-5
wait screen level
wait idle
shot 01_menobe
walk up 1
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $48 48 61
warp 3 114 62                # Guaron: block at 114-115, 60-61
wait screen level
wait idle
shot 02_guaron
walk up 1
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $53 68 45
warp 3 32 120                # Naval: block at 32-33, 118-119
wait screen level
wait idle
shot 03_naval
walk up 1
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $43 5 43
expect no-stderr map_patches
